    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "open",
      "narration_text": "Claude Code built the thirty concepts, ran the locks, tested GPU narration, and corrected physics in the storyboards, like orbit energy, where the storyboard had the burn backwards. I decided the speed-ups, gave the intro feedback, and published the Shorts.",
